2Fcustomer\u002Fbulk-upload",{"text":40,"link":41},"What you can and can't send",{"link_type":36,"key":42,"url":38},"8df6f1a3-55c3-4f75-8178-40d4ecee119a",{"heading":44,"subheading":45,"promo_text":45,"textImage":46,"cardTitle":47,"card_subtitle":45,"destinationsCsv":48,"defaultCountryId":56,"monotypeTitle":57},"Send a parcel to Hungary",null,{},"a tracked parcel from £8.89",{"link_type":49,"key":50,"kind":51,"id":52,"url":53,"name":54,"size":55},"Media","332b8958-ca30-4dcf-a44e-f57f7510beea","file","ZCwNmBEAACIAAJpg","hungary.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fdf0da68b-7584-4eca-a656-20f4b8338e1a_destination_countries_030423.csv","destination_countries_030423.csv","5329","25",{"dimensions":58,"alt":61,"copyright":45,"url":62,"id":63,"edit":64},{"width":59,"height":60},88,24,"Send","hungary.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+%281%29.svg","ZcyF-hIAACgAGOcv",{"x":65,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":67},0,1,"transparent","international_hero_banner$b0b0a913-8201-43ad-bb8c-844e93019266","international_hero_banner",{"variation":71,"version":31,"items":72,"primary":74,"id":111,"slice_type":112,"slice_label":45},"cardWithImageNoCta",[73],{},{"CardImage":75,"CardAvatar":83,"CardTitle":44,"CardText":84,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":76,"alt":45,"copyright":45,"url":79,"id":80,"edit":81},{"width":77,"height":78},1000,667,"hungary.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ2VA3JbqstJ98uU__Hungary.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=137%2C0%2C4498%2C3000&w=1000&h=667","Z2VA3JbqstJ98uU_",{"x":82,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":67},137,"none",[85,90,93],{"type":86,"text":87,"spans":88,"direction":89},"paragraph","Need to send a parcel to Hungary from the UK? Whether it’s a thoughtful gift for a loved one or a shipment for your business, we’re here to help. ",[],"ltr",{"type":86,"text":91,"spans":92,"direction":89},"Our courier services can deliver to any location in Hungary, from Budapest to Debrecen and beyond. We offer a fast and secure service, making sure your parcel arrives safely. Plus, with tracking included, you can follow your parcel’s journey every step of the way.",[],{"type":86,"text":94,"spans":95,"direction":89},"Plus, if you're sending parcels to the Czech Republic or other nearby countries, our international Courier service delivers to 200+ destinations.",[96,103,105,110],{"start":97,"end":98,"type":99,"data":100},16,53,"hyperlink",{"link_type":36,"url":101,"target":102},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fczech-republic","_blank",{"start":97,"end":98,"type":104},"strong",{"start":106,"end":107,"type":99,"data":108},85,114,{"link_type":36,"url":109,"target":102},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services",{"start":106,"end":107,"type":104},"card$bba4824a-b0d7-419b-9c3a-2fcdc9f7e789","card",{"variation":114,"version":31,"items":115,"primary":131,"id":140,"slice_type":141,"slice_label":45},"2ColumnTableButton",[116,119,122,125,128],{"Col1Content":117,"Col2Content":118},"250g","8.89",{"Col1Content":120,"Col2Content":121},"500g","£9.59",{"Col1Content":123,"Col2Content":124},"1kg","£10.89",{"Col1Content":126,"Col2Content":127},"2kg","£11.79",{"Col1Content":129,"Col2Content":130},"5kg","£33.69",{"SectionTitle":132,"SectionSubtitle":133,"Col1Header":134,"Col2Header":135,"InformationTableButtonUrl":136,"InformationTableButtonText":139,"isTableShort":20},"How much is it to post to Hungary?","The cost of sending a parcel to Hungary varies based on its weight. You can send up to 15kg in our network. Check out our pricing table below to see how little it costs to send some of our more popular parcel weights:","Parcel weight","Prices from",{"link_type":36,"key":137,"url":138},"c46492d7-0bc0-44ce-ad27-fa525f2f669d","hungary.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Finternational-send","Send parcels to Estonia","information_table$f82345cd-ef2a-46c0-baee-2cacc12cf155","information_table",{"variation":143,"version":31,"items":144,"primary":146,"id":205,"slice_type":112,"slice_label":45},"cardNoImageWithCta",[145],{},{"CardAvatar":83,"CardTitle":147,"CardText":148,"ButtonText":202,"ButtonUrl":203,"IsEco":20},"Scheduled Hungary public holidays",[149,152,158,162,167,172,177,181,186,190,194,198],{"type":86,"text":150,"spans":151,"direction":89},"While our couriers always aim to deliver parcels within 7 to 10 days, there may be cases where delivery times are increased due to certain local holidays. We’d recommend checking if your parcel could be in transit around any of the following days and sending earlier to help avoid potential delays:",[],{"type":153,"text":154,"spans":155,"direction":89},"list-item","New Year’s Day – 01\u002F01\u002F2026",[156],{"start":65,"end":157,"type":104},14,{"type":153,"text":159,"spans":160,"direction":89},"Revolution Day - 15\u002F03\u002F2026",[161],{"start":65,"end":157,"type":104},{"type":153,"text":163,"spans":164,"direction":89},"Good Friday – 03\u002F04\u002F2026",[165],{"start":65,"end":166,"type":104},13,{"type":153,"text":168,"spans":169,"direction":89},"Easter Monday – 06\u002F04\u002F2026",[170],{"start":65,"end":171,"type":104},15,{"type":153,"text":173,"spans":174,"direction":89},"Labour Day – 01\u002F05\u002F2026",[175],{"start":65,"end":176,"type":104},12,{"type":153,"text":178,"spans":179,"direction":89},"Pentecost Monday - 25\u002F05\u002F2026",[180],{"start":65,"end":97,"type":104},{"type":153,"text":182,"spans":183,"direction":89},"St. Stephen's Day - 20\u002F08\u002F2026",[184],{"start":65,"end":185,"type":104},17,{"type":153,"text":187,"spans":188,"direction":89},"Republic Day - 23\u002F10\u002F2026",[189],{"start":65,"end":176,"type":104},{"type":153,"text":191,"spans":192,"direction":89},"All Saints' Day - 01\u002F11\u002F2026",[193],{"start":65,"end":171,"type":104},{"type":153,"text":195,"spans":196,"direction":89},"Christmas Eve - 24\u002F12\u002F2026",[197],{"start":65,"end":157,"type":104},{"type":153,"text":199,"spans":200,"direction":89},"Christmas Day - 25\u002F12\u002F2026",[201],{"start":65,"end":166,"type":104},"Send to Hungary",{"link_type":36,"key":204,"url":138},"beff1d19-f6c1-41d5-9d01-ea39ed9c7b33","card$d590c818-c9ce-4fd6-a97b-18212c99f2cf",{"variation":207,"version":31,"items":208,"primary":271,"id":281,"slice_type":282,"slice_label":45},"3Column",[209,232,251],{"Title":210,"Description":215,"Image":219,"Label":45,"UrlText":213,"Url":227,"buttonDataGtmTrack":45,"SecondaryButtonText":45,"SecondaryButtonUrl":230,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":45,"ShowAppDownloadCta":45},[211],{"type":212,"text":213,"spans":214},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[216],{"type":86,"text":217,"spans":218,"direction":89},"Book your delivery online or in-store and bring your parcel to one of our 9,000+ ParcelShops. You’ll find us in places like your local corner shop and select Post Offices for easy access. If you need a label, use our free Print in ParcelShop device. Drop your parcel with the cashier, and we'll take it from there.",[],{"dimensions":220,"alt":222,"copyright":45,"url":223,"id":224,"edit":225},{"width":77,"height":221},665,"Evri blue ParcelShop sign hung from the ceiling of a store in one of the aisles. Stock on shelves is visible in the background.","hungary.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4",{"x":65,"y":226,"zoom":66,"background":67},8,{"link_type":36,"key":228,"url":229},"98dbdbac-8e6a-47bd-94ab-a078279cab43","\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":231},"Any",{"Title":233,"Description":237,"Image":241,"Label":45,"UrlText":235,"Url":247,"buttonDataGtmTrack":45,"SecondaryButtonText":45,"SecondaryButtonUrl":250,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":45,"ShowAppDownloadCta":45},[234],{"type":212,"text":235,"spans":236},"Lockers",[],[238],{"type":86,"text":239,"spans":240,"direction":89},"Our convenient and secure Lockers are available around the clock across the UK for fast, hassle-free delivery. Find your nearest  Locker using our website, then scan your barcode and drop off your parcel, and we’ll take care of the rest.",[],{"dimensions":242,"alt":243,"copyright":45,"url":244,"id":245,"edit":246},{"width":77,"height":221},"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","hungary.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&w=1000&h=665","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":65,"y":185,"zoom":66,"background":67},{"link_type":36,"key":248,"url":249},"55b01e80-1465-452a-9293-cd0e71f9310f","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":231},{"Title":252,"Description":256,"Image":260,"Label":45,"UrlText":266,"Url":267,"buttonDataGtmTrack":45,"SecondaryButtonText":45,"SecondaryButtonUrl":270,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":45,"ShowAppDownloadCta":45},[253],{"type":212,"text":254,"spans":255},"Couriers",[],[257],{"type":86,"text":258,"spans":259,"direction":89},"Need your parcel picked up from home or the office? Our couriers can come directly to you! Book a courier collection through our website for a day that suits you best. We’ll send you a one-hour window when we’ll be by to collect your parcel for delivery to Hungary.",[],{"dimensions":261,"alt":262,"copyright":45,"url":263,"id":264,"edit":265},{"width":77,"height":221},"A customer has just handed their parcel to an Evri courier as a part of a doorstep collection. The customer is being handed a blue slip as a receipt of the transaction.","hungary.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69xsZbqstJ9-pVA_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1545.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8158%2C5425&w=1000&h=665","Z69xsZbqstJ9-pVA",{"x":65,"y":226,"zoom":66,"background":67},"Courier services",{"link_type":36,"key":268,"url":269},"d6c9060d-979b-4939-9294-b077c761e78f","\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":231},{"SectionTitle":272,"SectionDescription":277,"theme":45},[273],{"type":274,"text":275,"spans":276,"direction":89},"heading2","How to send a parcel to Hungary",[],[278],{"type":86,"text":279,"spans":280,"direction":89},"We’ve made sending your parcels overseas quick and convenient thanks to our three easy options for you to choose from:",[],"article_link_module$380d507a-5f74-4888-80cd-627d9379f8f9","article_link_module",{"variation":143,"version":31,"items":284,"primary":285,"id":292,"slice_type":112,"slice_label":45},[],{"CardAvatar":83,"CardTitle":286,"CardText":287,"ButtonText":45,"ButtonUrl":291,"IsEco":20},"How long should sending parcels from the UK to Hungary take?",[288],{"type":86,"text":289,"spans":290,"direction":89},"The estimated time of delivery for sending parcels to Hungary is 7-10 working days using our Standard service.",[],{"link_type":231},"card$f7654c7d-a9bc-4af1-89a1-38cf6acfb82d",{"variation":294,"version":31,"items":295,"primary":297,"id":323,"slice_type":112,"slice_label":45},"default-slice",[296],{},{"CardImage":298,"CardAvatar":83,"CardTitle":305,"CardText":306,"ButtonText":320,"ButtonUrl":321,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":299,"alt":300,"copyright":45,"url":301,"id":302,"edit":303},{"width":77,"height":221},"Customer carrying multiple parcels inside a ParcelShop store, ready to drop off for delivery","hungary.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2468.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C7%2C6762%2C4497&w=1000&h=665","Z6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx",{"x":65,"y":304,"zoom":66,"background":67},7,"Send multiple parcels to Hungary",[307,310,314,317],{"type":86,"text":308,"spans":309,"direction":89},"If you have multiple parcels to ship or manage an international business, our bulk integration tool simplifies sending to Hungary. Handle all your parcels in one go:",[],{"type":311,"text":312,"spans":313,"direction":89},"o-list-item","Log in to your Evri account on our sister site and link your marketplace seller’s account - eBay, Etsy, Amazon, Shopify, or another platform. You can also upload parcels via CSV file.",[],{"type":311,"text":315,"spans":316,"direction":89},"Pack your items, book online, then print your postage label at home or in-store using our Print in ParcelShop device. ",[],{"type":311,"text":318,"spans":319,"direction":89},"Send your parcels through any of our 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers, or opt for a convenient courier collection.",[],"Send multiple items",{"link_type":36,"key":322,"url":38},"44497b4a-5078-4738-9af6-e8f1ad5899ff","card$fa303a60-84d8-4787-b754-15518974d525",{"variation":325,"version":31,"items":326,"primary":407,"id":411,"slice_type":412,"slice_label":45},"listComponent",[327,346,359,371,383,395],{"title":328,"content":329,"icon":339},"Regular tracking updates",[330],{"type":86,"text":331,"spans":332,"direction":89},"Keep updated on your parcel's progress with end-to-end tracking and notifications for you and your recipient at no extra cost",[333,338],{"start":334,"end":335,"type":99,"data":336},55,63,{"link_type":36,"url":337,"target":102},"\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":334,"end":335,"type":104},{"dimensions":340,"alt":342,"copyright":45,"url":343,"id":344,"edit":345},{"width":341,"height":341},40,"Phone icon","hungary.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":65,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":67},{"title":347,"content":348,"icon":352},"Parcel cover",[349],{"type":86,"text":350,"spans":351,"direction":89},"Every parcel you send includes £20 free cover. If your item’s worth more, you can easily increase the cover up to £999 for extra peace of mind!",[],{"dimensions":353,"alt":354,"copyright":45,"url":355,"id":356,"edit":357},{"width":341,"height":341},"Money icon","hungary.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":65,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":358},"#fff",{"title":360,"content":361,"icon":365},"Customs made easier",[362],{"type":86,"text":363,"spans":364,"direction":89},"Fill in customs information as part of your online booking without needing to print anything extra - we'll do the rest",[],{"dimensions":366,"alt":367,"copyright":45,"url":368,"id":369,"edit":370},{"width":341,"height":341},"Passport icon","hungary.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F00399f73-6c8a-4398-a945-07eba83626df_important+documents.svg","Yh96GBIAAC4A-Zsv",{"x":65,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":358},{"title":372,"content":373,"icon":377},"Flexible printing options",[374],{"type":86,"text":375,"spans":376,"direction":89},"Print your parcel labels at home or in-store for FREE",[],{"dimensions":378,"alt":379,"copyright":45,"url":380,"id":381,"edit":382},{"width":341,"height":341},"Printer icon","hungary.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsk",{"x":65,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":358},{"title":384,"content":385,"icon":389},"Bulk send",[386],{"type":86,"text":387,"spans":388,"direction":89},"Book multiple parcels online all at once using our bulk send tool",[],{"dimensions":390,"alt":391,"copyright":45,"url":392,"id":393,"edit":394},{"width":341,"height":341},"Laptop icon","hungary.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff4479625-5e04-45e8-9a20-77fa5893b64e_laptops.svg","Yh96GBIAAC8A-Zss",{"x":65,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":67},{"title":396,"content":397,"icon":401},"Trusted by top UK brands",[398],{"type":86,"text":399,"spans":400,"direction":89},"We're trusted to deliver for many of the UK's biggest retailers like ASOS, Boohoo, Gymshark, House of Fraser, Lonsdale and Lookfantastic, just to name a few",[],{"dimensions":402,"alt":403,"copyright":45,"url":404,"id":405,"edit":406},{"width":341,"height":341},"Success icon","hungary.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":65,"y":65,"zoom":66,"background":67},{"theme":408,"title":409,"description":410},"standard","Why send parcels to Hungary with Evri?","Similar to our local delivery service, you still get access to our range of benefits when you choose to send your parcel with us:","list_block$87389633-8af1-4da5-9f55-ee48a27248cd","list_block",{"variation":143,"version":31,"items":414,"primary":416,"id":442,"slice_type":112,"slice_label":45},[415],{},{"CardAvatar":83,"CardTitle":417,"CardText":418,"ButtonText":45,"ButtonUrl":441,"IsEco":20},"What you can and can’t send to Hungary",[419,429],{"type":86,"text":420,"spans":421,"direction":89},"While you can send lots of items to Hungary with Evri, there are a few limitations you’ll need to be aware of. You can find a full breakdown of what you can and can’t send internationally for the latest information. ",[422,428],{"start":423,"end":424,"type":99,"data":425},144,171,{"link_type":36,"url":426,"target":427},"hungary.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fwhat-i-can-and-cannot-send","_self",{"start":423,"end":424,"type":104},{"type":86,"text":430,"spans":431,"direction":89},"You should also follow the IATA Dangerous Goods Regulations and the UK Civil Aviation Authority guides to keep up to date with the latest restrictions for sending parcels to Hungary via airlines.",[432,437,438],{"start":433,"end":434,"type":99,"data":435},27,59,{"link_type":36,"url":436,"target":102},"hungary.html\u002F\u002Fwww.iata.org\u002Fen\u002Fpublications\u002Fdgr\u002F",{"start":433,"end":434,"type":104},{"start":439,"end":440,"type":104},68,95,{"link_type":231},"card$8b9d5118-024d-4b2c-ae3b-e430dc424436",{"variation":143,"version":31,"items":444,"primary":446,"id":471,"slice_type":112,"slice_label":45},[445],{},{"CardAvatar":83,"CardTitle":447,"CardText":448,"ButtonText":45,"ButtonUrl":470,"IsEco":20},"What address information you need for sending parcels to Hungary",[449,452,455,458,461,464,467],{"type":86,"text":450,"spans":451,"direction":89},"When you send a parcel to Hungary, simply enter the recipient’s postcode online and we’ll provide different address options for you to choose from.",[],{"type":86,"text":453,"spans":454,"direction":89},"We’ll make sure your label follows the correct format ready for printing. All you need to do is to check you have the correct details below before confirming your order:",[],{"type":153,"text":456,"spans":457,"direction":89},"The recipient's name",[],{"type":153,"text":459,"spans":460,"direction":89},"The street address",[],{"type":153,"text":462,"spans":463,"direction":89},"The city or town",[],{"type":153,"text":465,"spans":466,"direction":89},"4-digit postal code",[],{"type":153,"text":468,"spans":469,"direction":89},"Country",[],{"link_type":231},"card$6f66a640-ac28-4892-9a46-df43b1ecb324",{"variation":294,"version":31,"items":473,"primary":524,"id":526,"slice_type":527,"slice_label":45},[474,492],{"questionTitle":475,"questionBody":476},"Will I need to deal with customs when sending a parcel to Hungary?",[477,480,483],{"type":86,"text":478,"spans":479,"direction":89},"Some carriers ask you to print out a customs form and attach it to your parcel. Not with Evri. When you buy a parcel online, we automatically take all the information we need during checkout, making it even easier for you.",[],{"type":86,"text":481,"spans":482,"direction":89},"Be careful to fill in all the information correctly to make sure your parcel arrives at its destination as quickly as possible. If the information you provide is incorrect, it could result in your parcel being held at customs, with delays and charges outside of our control.",[],{"type":86,"text":484,"spans":485,"direction":89},"Check out our simple guide on how to send an international parcel for more information.",[486,491],{"start":487,"end":488,"type":99,"data":489},30,65,{"link_type":36,"url":490,"target":102},"\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-send-an-international-parcel",{"start":487,"end":488,"type":104},{"questionTitle":493,"questionBody":494},"Is there import tax from the UK to Hungary?",[495,498,507,510,513,516,519],{"type":212,"text":496,"spans":497,"direction":89},"UK business or marketplace seller? ",[],{"type":86,"text":499,"spans":500,"direction":89},"If you’re an online seller sending goods up to the value of €150 and to a destination within the EU, you might want to use Import One Stop Shop (IOSS). IOSS deals with VAT charges at the point of sale. So, as well as making life simpler for you, it also benefits your recipient - there’ll be no surprise costs for your customer when they receive their goods. Check out our guide on sending parcels to Europe to find out more about IOSS.​",[501,506],{"start":502,"end":503,"type":99,"data":504},382,407,{"link_type":36,"url":505,"target":102},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Feurope",{"start":502,"end":503,"type":104},{"type":86,"text":508,"spans":509,"direction":89},"If you haven’t sold through a marketplace or if your parcel destination is outside the EU, remember to let your recipient know they may need to pay customs charges.",[],{"type":212,"text":511,"spans":512,"direction":89},"International standard delivery service",[],{"type":86,"text":514,"spans":515,"direction":89},"If you're using our international standard delivery service, your recipient may need to pay taxes and duties either before your items leave the UK or when the parcel reaches its destination. ",[],{"type":86,"text":517,"spans":518,"direction":89},"If customs charges are applicable, Evri or the relevant authorities will contact your recipient with a secure payment link to clear customs before they can receive their items.",[],{"type":86,"text":484,"spans":520,"direction":89},[521,523],{"start":487,"end":488,"type":99,"data":522},{"link_type":36,"url":490,"target":102},{"start":487,"end":488,"type":104},{"title":525},"FAQs","frequently_asked_questions$57fefc8c-b2c9-4081-82a7-95a11a3df31f","frequently_asked_